      "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/d224fb87210badc347db34a0273100086445bb3c",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "e7d732ba280b084b303b3860b001ef7e93b5a7d7",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/e7d732ba280b084b303b3860b001ef7e93b5a7d7"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree e7d732ba280b084b303b3860b001ef7e93b5a7d7\nparent 108d7ff03c6b7cc5b0fa8bddae18e208a9eb2f09\nauthor Peter Zafonte <pzafonte@pm.me> 1793601878 +0900\ncommitter Peter Zafonte <pzafonte@pm.me> 1793654054 +0900\n\nvalidation: delete pruned files on a later flush\n\nFiles selected for pruning were kept in a local, so a failed flush left\nthem on disk until the next startup.\n\nKeep them in BlockManager and delete them after the next block index\nwrite. Take them with the dirty entries, which WriteBlockIndexDB() drops\neven if the write fails. Drop a file from the set once a block is\nwritten to it.\n\nPending files wait for the next periodic, forced or shutdown flush\nrather than forcing one, which would retry a failing write on every\nblock.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRDOJ0y42q5v3cnTlwCOQEUuCajwQUCauj9JhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQAjkBFLgmo8Ge/wD8D9S76ochDWoMVrAiByld\nor/KNVdfGLJxSWsHaxJ2xrgA/jshSpEdSXlW+3Zz4o/kbiSdKI4qmHbTd0LhsucP\njRAC\n=0ONg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
