          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/108d7ff03c6b7cc5b0fa8bddae18e208a9eb2f09"
        }
      ],
      "message": "validation: delete pruned files on a later flush\n\nFiles selected for pruning were kept in a local, so a failed flush left\nthem on disk until the next startup.\n\nKeep them in BlockManager and delete them after the next block index\nwrite. Take them with the dirty entries, which WriteBlockIndexDB() drops\neven if the write fails. Drop a file from the set once a block is\nwritten to it.\n\nPending files wait for the next periodic, forced or shutdown flush\nrather than forcing one, which would retry a failing write on every\nblock.",
      "committer": {
