      "body": "> m_files_to_unlink.erase(nFile);\n\nIs it actually possible for `nFile` to be in `m_files_to_unlink` here? `m_last_blockfile` contains the tip, and rolling over advances to a new file number.\n\nAlso, if an old file were somehow reused here, opening it with `rb+` would overwrite the head without truncating the existing block data on disk.",
